{"text": "DISTRICT COURT, ARAPAHOE COUNTY, COLORADO\nCase Number: 2025CV031447          Division: 204\n\nPlaintiff:   ROSALVA ZUBIRI\nv.\nDefendants:  HARTWELL RIDGE PROPERTY MANAGEMENT, LLC, and DEVON PETROV, individually\n\nAttorney for Plaintiff:\nThandiwe Dlamini, Atty. Reg. # 48817\nDlamini Kapoor LLC, 5350 S. Roslyn St., Ste. 310, Greenwood Village, CO 80111\nPhone 720-555-0137   Fax 720-555-0138   tdlamini@dlaminikapoor.example\n\n                    SUBPOENA TO PRODUCE (C.R.C.P. 45)\n\nTO:  (1) Custodian of Records, Sagelark Wireless, Inc., Subpoena Compliance, fax 866-555-0109\n     (2) Custodian of Records, Aspen Gold Bank, Legal Process Unit, PO Box 17730, Denver, CO 80217\n\nYOU ARE ORDERED to produce the records described in Exhibit A (to Sagelark) and Exhibit B (to the Bank) at the\noffice of Plaintiff's counsel above on or before December 5, 2025 at 10:00 a.m. Production by\nsecure upload with a records affidavit under Colorado Rules of Evidence 902(11) is accepted in place of appearance.\n\nEXHIBIT A -- Sagelark Wireless\nFor the period March 1, 2025 through July 31, 2025, for the account of subscriber\nDevon Petrov, account no. SW-9920-417736, and each line on it, including:\n   (303) 555-0172   (believed to be Mr. Petrov's personal line)\n   303-555-0198     (believed to be the on-call maintenance line for Hartwell Ridge)\n1. Subscriber and billing records, including the name, address and payment method on file.\n2. Call and text detail records (date, time, duration, numbers). Content of messages is NOT requested; see the\n   Stored Communications Act, 18 U.S.C. § 2702.\n3. Device history for each line, including the device with IMEI 35 364581 477864 8 and any SIM\n   change (ICCID 8901260882317764051).\n4. IP session logs showing the addresses assigned to those lines on June 14, 2025 between 9 p.m. and\n   midnight, and the subscriber to whom 198.51.100.77 and 2001:db8:4c0:1a2::9f were assigned at 10:42 p.m.\n   that night.\n\nEXHIBIT B -- Aspen Gold Bank\nFor the period 01/01/2024 to 09/30/2025:\n1. Statements, signature cards and deposit items for the Hartwell Ridge \"Tenant Security Deposits\" account\n   no. 4400 7718 2093 (routing 117139563) and operating account ending -5561.\n2. Records of every transfer from either account to any account held by Devon Petrov, including the\n   personal checking account ending in 0339.\n3. The deposit record and both sides of cashier's check no. 7002214 for $2,850.00, which Plaintiff\n   paid as a security deposit for 9841 E. Girard Ave., Unit 12B, Aurora, on 11/02/2023.\n\nPlaintiff alleges that her deposit was diverted and that, after she complained, Mr. Petrov sent her\nthreatening messages that referred to her immigration case. A protective order under C.R.C.P. 26(c) covers\nanything produced. Witness fee of $15.00 per C.R.S. § 13-25-126 is tendered with service.\n\nDate: November 12, 2025                 /s/ T. Dlamini\n\nRETURN OF SERVICE: served on Sagelark by fax and on the Bank by hand, 11/13/25, by Gareth Sinclair,\nMile High Legal Couriers. Fee $95. Questions about scope: Ms. Dlamini's paralegal, ext. 214.", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "461 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["ROSALVA ZUBIRI", "DEVON PETROV", "Thandiwe Dlamini", "Devon Petrov", "T. Dlamini", "Gareth Sinclair", "Sagelark"], "companies": ["HARTWELL RIDGE PROPERTY MANAGEMENT, LLC", "Sagelark Wireless, Inc", "Aspen Gold Bank"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.19999999925494194, "modelMs": 29233.300000000745, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 9, "end": 24, "text": "COURT, ARAPAHOE", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Arapahoe County District Court"}, {"start": 55, "end": 67, "text": "2025CV03